## Printed
heading: FUN'S CROSS-WORD PUZZLES
heading: Can You Solve Them?
number: No 15
intro: Today's cross work puzzle, the fifteenth in FUN'S series, was sent in by Miss Florence A. Reif of Honesdale, Pa. See if you can solve it. Fill in the little squares in the above diamond with words corresponding to the clews and definitions given below. On another page you will find the solution to last week's cross work puzzle. The solution to today's puzzle will be given in next week's FUN.
credit: was sent in by Miss Florence A. Reif of Honesdale, Pa.


